# VIGIL Core Rules

## Binding docs

Read and update `docs/memory/` and `.cursor/skills/vigil-s2-build/` before architectural changes.

## Honesty

- Paper trading only for S2. Never claim live capital results.
- Never invent Bitget UIDs, fills, Sharpe, or headlines.
- Label metrics `observed` | `estimated` | `targeted`.
- Do not claim the system is unhackable.

## No mocks on the trading path

- No static fake signals as source of truth.
- No silent LLM/Bitget/news fallbacks that invent data.
- Fail closed with typed errors when integrations are unavailable.

## Sessions & multitenancy

- httpOnly secure cookie sessions only — never localStorage for auth/secrets.
- Every business query filters by `tenant_id`.

## Secrets

- Secrets live in env / Secret Manager only.
- Never commit API keys or put them in memory MDs.

## Stack contract

- Frontend: TanStack Start + Cloudflare Nitro.
- Backend worker/DB/secrets: GCP Cloud Run + Cloud SQL + Secret Manager.
- LLM: AgentRouter primary (Tor egress from cloud VMs), Venice alternate — declare model in why-cards.
